      "text": "Division. A hill in Moab, opposite Jericho (Num. 21:20), whence Balaam (Num. 23:14) and Moses saw the land of Israel (Deut. 3:27; 34:1). Nebo and the top (or head) of Pisgah may be two names of the same peak.",
